OL,3,GNEWSAGP practice rated inadequate for
OL,4,Asafety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GP practice has had its rating for
OL,7,Fsafety cut from "good" to "inadequate"
OL,8,Fby the health watchdog.
OL,10,FAtrium Health Centre, in Dorchester,
OL,11,Fwas rated "requires improvement"
OL,12,Foverall after a Care Quality Commission
OL,13,F(CQC) inspection in May.
OL,15,FInspectors found 88 test results had
OL,16,Fnot been opened or acted on, and
OL,17,Frecords for three patients marked "do
OL,18,Fnot attempt resuscitation" with no
OL,19,Fevidence it had been discussed with
OL,20,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
